<title>PHILIPPINES: Philex says SEC okays capital increase.</title>
<headline>Philex says SEC okays capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philex Mining Corp said on Tuesday the Securities and Exchange Commission had approved the increase in its authorised capital to five billion pesos from two billion.</p>
<p>Philex told the Philippine Stock Exchange its capital structure will be comprised of three billion class A shares and two billion class B shares, both with a par value of one peso each.</p>
<p>The new shares will cover the 50 percent stock dividend declared for shareholders as of June 20.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
